00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Hey, Skylar, how are you?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Okay.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Oh.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Whitney Hodges: Well, it's good to see you guys. How's everything been going?

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Skyler: Pretty good.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Mm-hmm.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Skyler: Yeah?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Starting to pick back up for the fall, which is nice.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Skyler: Yeah.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah, we can already kind of see that on our end as well. You know, it's like things got a little bit more expensive with the Google Ads and Meta Ads over the summer, and now it's starting to like trend in the other direction to where things are kind of coming back down so we can see it.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Yes.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Whitney Hodges: you know, the… the engagement season kind of kicking into full speed, you know, that'll happen, like, November-ish.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Yeah. Okay.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Skyler: Yeah, well, and it doesn't help that just everything in general is expensive right now.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Whitney Hodges: Right.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Skyler: So…

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Whitney Hodges: Is that what you're feeling on your end with your leads, that they're just, like, really budget conscious at this point? Yeah.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Skyler: Yes. Big time, like taking a really long time to book, like, or at least more, more of them are, um, not all of them. Some of them just are ready, but a lot of more of them are like wanting to see every single vendor and how much it costs and this and that. We're like, we don't get to see that side. Like you're going to have to reach out.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Mm-hmm.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Whitney Hodges: Good.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Whitney Hodges: Thank you.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Whitney Hodges: Thank you.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Skyler: To those vendors, like, if you're needing a budget, then you're gonna have to do that work, you know?

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Whitney Hodges: Got it. Okay, yeah, so it's like they're researching all of the vendors and kind of trying to come up with comprehensive pricing before they're ready to pull the trigger with you guys, it sounds like.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Skyler: Oh.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Skyler: Yes.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Skyler: Yes.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, yeah, I definitely could see how that could be.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:28.000
Skyler: And then in the last week, it was crazy, I thought it was… I was telling my husband this, but we had two people book a January and February date of this coming year, and that's, like, such a quick turnaround, so… but they get discounts for it, because we're offering discounts for those dates, so I think that helps, and…

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Whitney Hodges: Wow.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: And…

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Skyler: You know.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Mm-hmm. Yeah, we were hearing that from…

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Skyler: We're either seeing really quick… we're either seeing really quick turnaround, or people being like, we're looking at summer 2028, and I'm like, huh?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Hailey Horne: I had I had my first twenty twenty nine one yesterday.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

