00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.000
Amanda Castorena: But they'll wait to book until they're a year out, so…

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Hailey Horne: Well, that's what they were telling me. They're touring. This was their eighth venue that they had toured yesterday, but they won't book until minimum of February. So that's only five months away.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Yeah.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.000
Whitney Hodges: Mmhm.

