00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Skyler: my tours.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah, it's some sort of, like, reminder in your system, or some sort of…

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.000
Skyler: Yeah, I know.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Thank you, Bruce.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.000
Whitney Hodges: On the way to things.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Yeah.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:33.000
