00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Hailey Horne: Bye.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.000
Skyler: That's funny.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:54.000
Whitney Hodges: That's a good idea. Um, yeah, but we're hearing the same thing from other venues. A venue that I met with yesterday, who's, um… they're, like, outside of San Antonio. They're saying that they're still getting leads for… for this year. Um, and they were like, that's crazy, we have… we've never gotten…

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Okay.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.000
Hailey Horne: Mm-hmm.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:09.000
Whitney Hodges: short-term stuff, um, like that. Um, and we're also saying that they've been getting a lot of inquiries for micro-weddings, even though they don't really necessarily advertise for micro-weddings. Have you guys been seeing that, too? Yeah.

