00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.000
Skyler: Mm-hmm.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:22.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: We've been getting a lot of that too. Yeah. Yeah. People who want like 50 people or they, and then it makes me wonder, cause we advertise for our 450 capacity. So.

