Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.000
Whitney Hodges: I heard you say that.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:26.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Most people come to us without knowing that that's something that they would want. So, and we talk about it on tours and stuff, so.

