Skyler: I don't think it's necessary.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:54.000
Skyler: Yeah, I don't think it's necessary, um, because we're able to, like, when people inquire about that, we're able to share that, and in our brochure, we do have, like, in our inquiry brochure, when we send it out, we do have, like, a little thing underneath the pricing that says you can ask about our elopement and half-day rentals.

