Skyler: Mm-hmm.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:33.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: We don't have any Saturdays left, so it's wordy. I don't know how you would incorporate it into something that people would pay attention to, but…

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:38.000
