00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Mm-hmm.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:49.000
Whitney Hodges: Got it. Okay, that… that makes sense. Yeah, so probably not necessarily something we would want to work into ad copy at this point, but when they're…

