Skyler: Yeah. Well, it's really that dang August that always.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.000
The Weinberg At Wixon Valley: Yeah.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:37.000
Skyler: they'll just open. I don't… we don't understand why, um, you know, when we opened the chapel.

